{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Amazon 為 AirPods Pro 3 帶來網購優惠，現價 US$179，較原價 US$249 減 28%。同場的 AirPods Max 2 現價 US$429，較原價 US$549 減 22%，兩款都有明顯減幅。AirPods Pro 3 在降噪、心率感應與即時翻譯方面都有升級，適合想更新日常耳機的用家。以現時價位來看，現在是入手的好時機。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"AirPods Max 2\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/71umw2c-Ck-OL.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure>\n<h2>AirPods Pro 3 重點功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>全新聲學架構</strong>：低音更厚、人聲更清晰，主動降噪比 AirPods Pro 2 最多強 2 倍，無論通勤、搭車或在嘈雜環境工作，都能更專注聆聽音樂與內容。</li>\n<li><strong>心率感應與運動記錄</strong>：新增心率感應，支援 50 種運動類型，配合 iPhone 可記錄 Move 圓環與 Workout Buddy，方便用家掌握訓練與日常活動狀況，更瞭解身體反應。</li>\n<li><strong>即時翻譯與聽力支援</strong>：支援 Live Translation 即時翻譯；在家可做聽力測試，Hearing Aid 功能加入自動對話增強，無論外遊溝通或日常聆聽都更方便清晰。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FQFB8FMG?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple AirPods Pro 3 Wireless Earbuds with Active Noise Cancellation | Live Translation, Heart Rate Sensing, Hearing Aid Feature, Bluetooth Headphones, Spatial Audio, USB-C Charging\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/218Mmzk0EaL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FQFB8FMG?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple AirPods Pro 3 Wireless Earbuds with Active Noise Cancellation | Live Translation, Heart Rate Sensing, Hearing Aid Feature, Bluetooth Headphones, Spatial Audio, USB-C Charging</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$179.00</p>\n<p>$249.00</p>\n<p>-28%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FQFB8FMG?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GSS4SGZR?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Apple AirPods Max 2 Wireless Over-Ear Headphones – Midnight | Active Noise Cancellation, Adaptive Audio, Personalized Spatial Audio, Live Translation, Bluetooth Headphones for iPhone\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31CNtXA4IRL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GSS4SGZR?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Apple AirPods Max 2 Wireless Over-Ear Headphones – Midnight | Active Noise Cancellation, Adaptive Audio, Personalized Spatial Audio, Live Translation, Bluetooth Headphones for iPhone</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$429.00</p>\n<p>$549.00</p>\n<p>-22%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GSS4SGZR?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<h2>為什麼會顯示沒有貨？</h2>\n<p>如果大家的 Amazon 帳號設定了本地地址，這樣當顯示美國限定產品時是會顯示「沒有供應」，然而大家只要輸入一些<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/2019/05/06/buy-and-ship/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">集運公司的地址</a>，這樣就可以正常顯示價格及送貨。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Amazon 美國送貨地址設定\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"868\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/amazon-us-address.jpg\" width=\"1630\"/></figure>\n<h2>購買美版的 AppleCare 保修問題</h2>\n<p>不少人也對海外購買 Apple 產品的保修有疑問，其實 Apple 產品很多時也是全球性維修，不過 AppleCare+ 的意外換機則必須要原來的購買地才可。那就是你不能買美國版 AppleCare+ 在香港／台灣要求意外更換，必須要在美國更換。不過，維修一般沒有問題，當然每個地區的 Apple Store 也有其不同的。</p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T11:36:31.007572+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1162,"images":4,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T11:10:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T23:17:33.521205+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T11:29:50.395166+00:00","content_hash":"ddd3caca10152cca86c994e6135037c6229cc91e3ac9018c4ba384a696cfb535","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T11:36:31.007572+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}